@@ -0,0 +1,27 @@
+---
+id: dl-001-make-delivery-charges-vat-exempt
+type: decision-log
+title: "Make delivery charges VAT-exempt"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Context
+
+The current product rule and implementation charge delivery at the standard VAT rate.
+Anna reports that delivery is a service rather than goods and requests that the service
+stop charging VAT on it. This changes the product's documented tax policy and affects
+order totals, receipts, and invoice VAT summaries.
+
+## Decision
+
+Treat delivery charges as VAT-exempt. Delivery will contribute zero VAT to order totals,
+will no longer be included in standard-rate invoice VAT summaries, and receipts will no
+longer show VAT on shipping.
+
+## Consequences
+
+Orders with paid shipping will cost 22% less VAT on the delivery charge. The README,
+pricing calculation, receipt rendering, invoice VAT summary, and regression tests must
+be updated together. Existing historical orders are in-memory values and are not
+migrated by this library.
